# SAKG S1 Extraction Feasibility Spike — falsifying SAEOS-1 §9/A8

> **Canonical path note.** This artifact's specified deliverable path is
> `reviews/spikes/sakg-s1-extraction-probe.md`. This worker's write capability is
> scoped to `design/` only, so it is written here. **It is byte-complete and must be
> moved verbatim to `reviews/spikes/sakg-s1-extraction-probe.md`** by a session
> holding that scope; the frontmatter and `## goal:` headings are shaped to satisfy
